{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"0df464cfbaea6f9396199a4913d26d476a75d39b44ab41dbf828c155519124b9","slug":"outlook","location":"/outlook.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"展望","numbering":{"all":{"enabled":false},"title":{"offset":1}},"content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Lukas Heumos","given":"Lukas","family":"Heumos"},"name":"Lukas Heumos","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-0"},{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Anna Schaar","given":"Anna","family":"Schaar"},"name":"Anna Schaar","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-1"},{"nameParsed":{"literal":"single-cell best practices consortium","given":"single-cell","non_dropping_particle":"best practices","family":"consortium"},"name":"single-cell best practices consortium","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-2"}],"github":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices","settings":{"output_matplotlib_strings":"remove"},"source_url":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices/blob/main/.build/v2-candidate/community-notice-2026-09-16-02/overlay/outlook.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/theislab/single-cell-best-practices/edit/main/.build/v2-candidate/community-notice-2026-09-16-02/overlay/outlook.md","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"outlook.md","url":"/single-cell-best-practices-zh/build/outlook-3633cb519e0b8a95c4d9630b95dcb2e3.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"单细胞领域快速发展，新工具不断涌现。它们为科学发现提供了更多途径，也让研究者面临更复杂的工具选择。","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"i8ngfue4Du"}],"key":"Fi90jH2EbW"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"基准评估","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"fVOjvOz9YI"}],"identifier":"benchmarking","label":"Benchmarking","html_id":"benchmarking","implicit":true,"key":"KyXAndFgvg"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"工具数量持续增长，使定期开展基准评估（benchmarking）愈发重要。例如，","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"UYwu1ln100"},{"type":"link","url":"https://openproblems.bio/","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Open Problems in Single-Cell Analysis","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"FJ0IqiQOY0"}],"urlSource":"https://openproblems.bio/","key":"t53Di7pd3F"},{"type":"text","value":" 使用标准数据集和明确定义的指标比较方法，为工具选择提供依据。有效的基准评估需要社区围绕每项任务形成合适的评价标准，因此，讨论什么样的分析结果才算可靠也会越来越重要。本书将随新的基准结果和方法建议更新相应章节。","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"key":"iEeX0STBeK"}],"key":"Yrh3El2GLM"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"图谱构建与参考映射","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"I1Zaq1sr9r"}],"identifier":"atlas-building-and-reference-mapping","label":"Atlas building and reference mapping","html_id":"atlas-building-and-reference-mapping","implicit":true,"key":"k3kKRXAe68"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"随着单细胞图谱积累，细胞注释（cell annotation）有望逐渐增加自动化程度， ","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"SWKT3xgit7"},{"type":"emphasis","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"借助","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"BumEpkP3Uj"}],"key":"K2E5u4mBXl"},{"type":"text","value":" 参考映射（reference mapping）利用已有知识。为此，参考图谱既要覆盖健康状态，也要包含疾病等不同条件。映射的不确定性还可辅助质量控制（quality control, QC）：难以映射的细胞可能质量较低，也可能属于参考未覆盖的细胞类型或状态，或受到批次、技术差异影响。应结合这些因素进一步检查，不能仅凭映射困难判定其质量或生物学价值。","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"sQGMjGcZks"}],"key":"wAhV8xMZhr"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"模态预测","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":23,"column":1}},"key":"yVChzdHUkT"}],"identifier":"modality-prediction","label":"Modality prediction","html_id":"modality-prediction","implicit":true,"key":"KKJD1mAeWw"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"单细胞分析正从单模态（unimodal）走向多模态（multimodal），以更全面地描述细胞。然而，并非所有实验都能测量全部模态，因此模态预测（modality prediction）和未配对整合（unpaired integration）将越来越有用。这些方法提供依赖数据与模型的推断，不能替代缺失模态的实际测量。","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":1},"end":{"line":25,"column":1}},"key":"GvbnVXPvjM"}],"key":"I79S0o9rAt"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1},"end":{"line":28,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"端到端分析流程","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":1},"end":{"line":28,"column":1}},"key":"rj1zvFe6aa"}],"identifier":"end-to-end-pipelines","label":"End-to-end pipelines","html_id":"end-to-end-pipelines","implicit":true,"key":"opGSICB3hS"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"单细胞数据规模与分析任务不断增长，推动更多步骤实现自动化。参考图谱映射和自动化质量控制，为构建高度自动化的端到端流程（end-to-end pipeline）提供了基础。对已有数据重新分析，也可能发现先前遗漏的生物学现象。相关流程已开始出现 ","position":{"start":{"line":30,"column":1},"end":{"line":30,"column":1}},"key":"ClnY59gPb7"},{"type":"citeGroup","kind":"parenthetical","children":[{"type":"cite","kind":"parenthetical","label":"ol:Khozoie2021","identifier":"ol:khozoie2021","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Khozoie ","key":"WgXPQUouVz"},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"et al.","key":"jVQCMZ6TXS"}],"key":"vfdKivRgDx"},{"type"